":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T18:01:57-07:00","id":960137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangle77</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/940814-anyone-else-already-thinking-about-halloween?p=960106#post960106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I literally just applied \u200bfor a job with My local Spirit Halloween 10 seconds ago.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome! Good luck! Hope you get it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10575-lilappleblossom","name":"lilappleblossom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T11:25:07-07:00","id":967423,"title":"","content":"<br /> One of these years, I'm gonna have a Halloween Tree!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/236x/ea/c8/2a/eac82a877fb01af0c935722c22cc35d4.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://www.halloweenforum.com/attachments/general-halloween/213378-halloween-tree-img_0113.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I haven't done anything really special for Halloween in years...last thing I did was attend an Alice Cooper concert some years back, then hung out with all the goths afterwards! I don't get trick or treaters at my apartment building, so I'll probably just head to my parents and help them pass out candy, if I'm not at work. My job used to have candy stations so kids could ToT inside the store, but we haven't done that in awhile...Halloween decorations/merch is going up today. I'm making it my mission to suggest as many Sexy Nurse/Cat/Pirate costumes as I can, I've got a quota to keep!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> The main thing I buy for myself is usually a couple of candy corn/pumpkin spice scented candles, then I put on my Halloween mix tape, and settle back with some Edgar Allen Poe/Thomas Ligotti stories!<br /> <br /> Incidentally, about half of my Halloween mix is <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r9YSmzC6oy8#t=0m33s\" target=\"_blank\">spooky, yet melodic</a>, incidental music from Danny Elfman, with the rest being from various movies, games, etc. What would be on your ideal mix?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T13:06:33-07:00","id":967482,"title":"","content":"My ideal Halloween mix? Here it is....<br /> <br /> \u200bMinistry: &quot;Everyday is Halloween&quot;<br /> Bobby Boris Pickett: &quot;The Monster Mash&quot;<br /> Creedence Clearwater Revival: &quot;Bad Moon Rising&quot;<br /> Golden Earring: &quot;Twilight Zone&quot;<br /> King Harvest: &quot;Dancing in the Moonlight&quot;<br /> Marilyn Manson: &quot;This Is Halloween&quot;<br /> John Fogerty: &quot;Blue Moon of Kentucky&quot;<br /> Paul Giovanni: &quot;Corn Rigs&quot;<br /> 